    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get in, loser, we\u2019re wedding crashing.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andy Min is having the worst summer: on top of dropping out of med school, she\u2019s been uninvited from her ex-best friend\u2019s wedding. Join her and her imaginary friend Fishy on a cross-country drive to eat burgers, crash a wedding, and perhaps even find closure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: closure sold separately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769330/extras/1c70ba083126f4c3e3d72e968e07e5cf.avif?t=1755458719\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of pure road trip chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back pain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable gas station food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple diner burger options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An imaginary fish friend who loves you very much</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And a surprise celebrity guest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769330/extras/a5b32767dcbda7763de3ed9496029a2e.avif?t=1755458719\" data-has-big width=800 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Road Trip to the End of the World</i> is a linear visual novel with point-and-click elements. Enjoy your trip, wherever it may lead you.</p>",
